7D7AF][/dim]Agents-tab load tier, so previously dismissed agents stop appearing[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]and disappearing in `sase ace`.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase/repos/plans/202607/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]ghost_imported_agents.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Make Agents-tab dismissal tier-independent[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]dismissal_invariant[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'Phase 1 — Make Agents-tab dismissal tier-independent' section: fold [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]dismissed-bundle identities into the TUI loader's effective dismissed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]set behind a signature-cached snapshot so index-backed and source-scan [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]loads hide the same rows.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Record imported dismissals in dismissed_agents.json[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]import_dismissal_record[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'Phase 2 — Record imported dismissals in dismissed_agents.json' section:[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]extend the v2 import transaction so finalizing an import adds each [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]imported run identity to the dismissed-agents state file alongside the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bundle it already writes.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stop minting future-dated imported timestamps[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]timestamp_provenance[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'Phase 3 — Stop minting future-dated imported timestamps' section: carry[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]real commit timestamps through commit-only publication records and make [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the import destination-timestamp fallback provably never exceed the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]current time.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Break the publish/import/re-publish amplification loop[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]import_loop_break[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'Phase 4 — Break the publish/import/re-publish amplification loop' [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]section: stamp import provenance onto dismissed bundles, teach the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]inventory import detector to recognize it, and stop self-imports from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]re-materializing history the local machine already owns.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Repair existing ghost artifacts, bundles, and registry rows[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]state_repair[dim] · [dim][/dim]after import_dismissal_record, timestamp_provenance, [/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]import_loop_break[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'Phase 5 — Repair existing ghost artifacts, bundles, and registry rows' [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]section: add an idempotent, dry-run-by-default repair command that [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]purges already-written future-dated imported state, plus a round-trip [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]regression test proving publish/import/re-publish converges.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-9o","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-9o.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-0e375b139bf61bae9eac8bc308590d2a","started_at":"2026-07-26T10:00:32.784229+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1785060948,"sha":"e0fbcecc8f3b4709c1aeea7fa9769fbce8064e72","subject":"f